{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/state/state-machines","title":"State machines","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"state-machines","children":[{"t":"text","text":"State machines"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftStateMachine"},{"t":"text","text":" models a finite workflow as a named, typed, reactive"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"primitive. It is useful when a feature has a small set of meaningful modes —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"for example, an editor that is either reading or editing, a form that moves"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"through validation and submission, or a resource that moves through loading,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"success and failure."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The important part is not only that the machine has states. It is that the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"states and the transitions are "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"100% declarative"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the machine describes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"which events can enter each state, and Craft derives the current state from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"those declarations at runtime."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"a-different-perspective-on-transitions","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A different perspective on transitions"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Many state-machine APIs describe a transition from the current state:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"while in reading, when edit happens, go to editing"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"That perspective makes the target explicit in the transition itself. You look"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"at the "},{"t":"code","text":"reading"},{"t":"text","text":" state's handlers to discover where an "},{"t":"code","text":"edit"},{"t":"text","text":" event goes."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft reverses the perspective. Each entry in the transitions record describes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"how to enter that step"}]},{"t":"text","text":". The record key is the target step, and "},{"t":"code","text":"transit()"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"inside that step's block means “attempt to enter this step”. It does not take a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"state name because the surrounding key already supplies it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If you are used to XState or a similar state-machine API, the difference is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the direction in which you read the same workflow graph. You may usually start"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"from "},{"t":"code","text":"reading"},{"t":"text","text":" and ask “where does "},{"t":"code","text":"edit"},{"t":"text","text":" go?”. In Craft, you start from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"editing"},{"t":"text","text":" and ask “which event makes the machine enter "},{"t":"code","text":"editing"},{"t":"text","text":"?”. The graph"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is still explicit; its declarations are owned by their destination step."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"context"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"transit"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    reading: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"transitionStep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"initStateMachine","kind":"function"},{"text":"(() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(context.commit$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(context.cancel$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    editing: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"transitionStep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(context.edit$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  };","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reading this declaration tells you immediately:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"reading"},{"t":"text","text":" is entered during initialisation, after "},{"t":"code","text":"commit"},{"t":"text","text":", or after"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"cancel"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"editing"},{"t":"text","text":" is entered after "},{"t":"code","text":"edit"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"There is no "},{"t":"code","text":"currentStep = ..."},{"t":"text","text":", no imperative transition table, and no string"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"such as "},{"t":"code","text":"transit('editing')"},{"t":"text","text":". The destination is the step whose block declared"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the event. If an event attempts to enter the step that is already active, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"attempt is a no-op."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This makes the transition logic especially easy to inspect: to answer “when"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"can the machine enter "},{"t":"code","text":"reading"},{"t":"text","text":"?”, read the "},{"t":"code","text":"reading"},{"t":"text","text":" block and look at the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"events it listens to. The machine's transition behavior is visible in the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declarations themselves."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The same principle applies to the steps themselves. Each step registered in a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craftStateMachine"},{"t":"text","text":" can be 100% declarative: its context can be assembled from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft primitives, its event reactions can be expressed with "},{"t":"code","text":"on$"},{"t":"text","text":", and its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"view can be selected from the typed step context. A step does not need an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"imperative “enter” function that manually changes the machine or coordinates"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the rest of the feature."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-text-editor-example","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The text editor example"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The demo application contains a complete "},{"t":"link","href":"https://github.com/craft-ts/craft-ts/blob/main/apps/demo/src/app/examples/primitives/state-machine/text-editor.ts","external":true,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"declarative text editor"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"example"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"It has two steps:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"reading  ← initialisation, commit, cancel"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"editing  ← edit"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The machine's context owns the events and the text state. The transitions only"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declare which events enter which step:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"machine"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"yield","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"*","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"craftStateMachine","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"'textEditor'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"edit$"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"source$","kind":"function"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"void","kind":"type"},{"text":">(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'text.edit'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"commit$"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"source$","kind":"function"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"void","kind":"type"},{"text":">(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'text.commit'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"cancel$"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"source$","kind":"function"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"void","kind":"type"},{"text":">(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'text.cancel'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"text"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"'text'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        { committedValue: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"''","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", value: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"''","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"insertStatePipe","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"insertDeepYieldable","kind":"function"},{"text":"(), ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"patch"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"change","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"value"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"string","kind":"type"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"patch","kind":"function"},{"text":"(() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({ value })),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          commit: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(commit$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"            "},{"text":"patch","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"current"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({ committedValue: current.value })),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          ),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          cancel: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(cancel$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"            "},{"text":"patch","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"current"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({ value: current.committedValue })),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          ),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        })),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      );","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { edit$, commit$, cancel$, text };","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"context"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"transit"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        reading: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"transitionStep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"initStateMachine","kind":"function"},{"text":"(() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(context.commit$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(context.cancel$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        editing: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"transitionStep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(context.edit$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      };","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"text"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"cancel$"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"commit$"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"edit$"},{"text":" }) {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        reading: { text, edit$ },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        editing: { text, commit$, cancel$ },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      };","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  );","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The first factory creates the shared context. The second factory declares the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"machine's steps and their incoming events. The third factory gives each step a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"typed context for its view: the reading view can edit, while the editing view"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"can commit or cancel."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"insertDeepYieldable()"},{"t":"text","text":" makes the object-valued "},{"t":"code","text":"text"},{"t":"text","text":" state deeply readable."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The template can therefore bind to "},{"t":"code","text":"reading.text.value"},{"t":"text","text":" and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"reading.text.committedValue"},{"t":"text","text":" without creating a separate "},{"t":"code","text":"craftComputed"},{"t":"text","text":" for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"each property."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"rendering-the-current-step","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Rendering the current step"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The machine exposes "},{"t":"code","text":"currentStep"},{"t":"text","text":" as a union of step names and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"currentStepWithContext"},{"t":"text","text":" as a discriminated union. Use the latter when each"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"step needs different data or actions:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"matchNode.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"exhaustive","kind":"function"},{"text":"(machine.currentStepWithContext, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'step'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"reading","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"reading"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"div","kind":"function"},{"text":"([","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"([","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Committed value: '","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", reading.text.committedValue]),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"([","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Current value: '","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", reading.text.value]),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"click","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" reading.edit$.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"emit","kind":"function"},{"text":"() }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Edit'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    ]),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"editing","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"editing"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"div","kind":"function"},{"text":"([","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"input","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        value: editing.text.value,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"input","kind":"function"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"event"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" editing.text.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"change","kind":"function"},{"text":"(event.target.value);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"click","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" editing.commit$.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"emit","kind":"function"},{"text":"() }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Commit'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"click","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" editing.cancel$.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"emit","kind":"function"},{"text":"() }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Cancel'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    ]),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"matchNode.exhaustive"},{"t":"text","text":" checks that every step is handled, and narrows the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"handler argument to that step's context. Adding a new step therefore produces"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"compile-time feedback both in the machine's transition record and in the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rendering code."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If the view only needs the name, use the shorter scalar form:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"matchNode.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"exhaustive","kind":"function"},{"text":"(machine.currentStep, {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"reading","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Reading'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"editing","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Editing'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"guards","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Guards"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The event declaration says when a transition is attempted. A"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"transitionGuard"},{"t":"text","text":" says whether that attempt is accepted. Guards can be local to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"one step, global to the machine, or attached to one particular attempt:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"editing"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"transitionStep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"on$","kind":"function"},{"text":"(context.edit$, () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"transit","kind":"function"},{"text":"().","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pipe","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"transitionGuard","kind":"function"},{"text":"(({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"context"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" context.form.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"isValid","kind":"function"},{"text":"()),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    ),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  );","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}),","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A guard can also be a generator and yield Craft services. Those dependencies"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"become part of the machine's dependency graph. This keeps the condition"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declarative as well: the transition is still described by its event and its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"accepted predicate, rather than by an imperative event handler that manually"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"coordinates state."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"effect-services-in-a-guard","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effect services in a guard"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"In an Effect-enabled frontend, use "},{"t":"code","text":"transitionGuardEffect"},{"t":"text","text":" when the decision is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declared synchronous and needs an Effect service. It is the Effect-aware form"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of "},{"t":"code","text":"transitionGuard"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { Context, Effect, Layer } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'effect'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { SyncOp, transitionGuardEffect } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/effect'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"type